    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Ismaili Imamat has announced it will be donating US$10 million to support relief efforts following the severe flooding in Pakistan.  $5m will be donated directly to the Government of Pakistan while a further $5m will be provided to the Aga Khan Development Network (AKDN) agencies, including the Aga Khan University, which are engaged in the relief efforts in the country.",
